{title: Awesome In This Place}
{key: G}

{comment: Intro}
[G-G2-G-C]

{comment: Verse}
As I [Em]come into Your presence, [C2]past the gates of praise
In[Em]to Your sanctuary, 'til we're [C2]standing face to face
I [D]look upon Your countenance
I see the [G]fullness [D/Gb]of Your [C9]grace
And I can [Am]only bow down and [D]say

{comment: Chorus}
You are [G]awesome in this place, mighty [Am]God
You are [Am]awesome in this [D]place, Abba [G]Father[D]
You are [G]worthy of all praise, to [C]You our lives we [Am]raise
You are [Ammaj7]awesome in this [D/Gb]place, mighty [G]God

